@startuml components
title Layered component view

package "Composition root" {
  [main.cpp] as Main
}

package "Presentation" {
  [Application] as App
  [ConsoleReportFormatter] as Report
  [KerbinTimeFormatter] as Time
}

package "Domain" {
  [ConstellationCalculator] as Calc
  [OrbitalMechanics] as Mech
}

package "Data" {
  [KspBodyDatabase] as DB
}

package "Value types" {
  [CelestialBody] as Body
  [OrbitalResult] as Result
}

actor Player
Player --> App : stdin / stdout

Main ..> App : constructs + injects
Main ..> Calc
Main ..> Report
Main ..> Time
Main ..> DB
Main ..> Mech

App --> DB : IBodyDatabase
App --> Calc : IConstellationCalculator
App --> Report : IReportFormatter
App --> Mech : sync / SOI queries
Report --> Time : ITimeFormatter
Calc --> Mech : IOrbitalMechanics

DB ..> Body
Calc ..> Body
Calc ..> Result
Report ..> Result

note bottom of Mech
  Pure functions:
  no I/O, no state
end note
@enduml
